## Upstream notices (retained, not superseded)

This repository incorporates work from upstream MIT-licensed projects. Their
copyright notices are retained in the files below and continue to apply to the
paths listed. The notice above does not replace them.

| Scope | Upstream notice |
|---|---|
| `interactive/server/sap-assets/` (30 files) · `interactive/server/tool-catalog/` (4) · `interactive/server/verify-engine.mjs` · `interactive/server/bundle-keyring.mjs` — **36 files** | `interactive/LICENSE` — derived from `babamba2/superclaude-for-sap` |

The scope column was narrowed from the whole `interactive/` subtree on
2026-08-22 (decision D-103). The borrowed knowledge, persona, procedure and
policy content it used to cover has since been re-authored in full, and the 36
files above are what actually remains. Narrowing the scope does not retire the
notice — `docs/BLUEPRINT.md` §1.3 records what each remaining file is and on
what condition it can retire.

Component-level attribution for the distributed plugin, including bundled
runtime dependencies, is in `interactive/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
